{"id":9178,"date":"2021-05-21T00:00:00","date_gmt":"2021-05-21T06:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rethinkfirst.com\/resources\/key-employment-issues-every-aba-provider-should-know-about\/"},"modified":"2024-10-04T19:26:45","modified_gmt":"2024-10-04T23:26:45","slug":"key-employment-issues-every-aba-provider-should-know-about","status":"publish","type":"resources","link":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/resources\/key-employment-issues-every-aba-provider-should-know-about\/","title":{"rendered":"Key Employment Issues Every ABA Provider Should Know About"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"9178\" class=\"elementor elementor-9178\" data-elementor-post-type=\"resources\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-47744ee1 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"47744ee1\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-653fdb4f\" data-id=\"653fdb4f\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-46545c35 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"46545c35\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"videoDivHolder\"><div><video poster=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/485-MTEyNDk2Nw_key-employment-issues-every-aba-provider-should-know-about_thumbnail.jpg\" controls=\"controls\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\"> <source src=\"https:\/\/rtaprodmarketing.blob.core.windows.net\/rta-prod-marketingvideos\/485-MTEyNDk2Nw_key-employment-issues-every-aba-provider-should-know-about.mp4\" type=\"video\/mp4\" \/> <\/video><\/div><\/div><p><style> #videoDivHolder { width: 100%; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; } #videoDivHolder > div { position: relative; overflow: hidden; width: 100%; padding-top: 56.25%; } #videoDivHolder > div video { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; bottom: 0; right: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; } <\/style><\/p><h2>Description<\/h2><p>Join us on Thursday, May 20 as we discuss common employment issues faced by businesses and entrepreneurs. Learn how to mitigate risk and avoid potential pitfalls of non-compliance.<\/p><h2>Learning Objectives<\/h2><ul><li>Employment laws affecting all employers<\/li><li>Violating a law you didn\u2019t know existed<\/li><li>Where to look for help and guidance in this complex terrain<\/li><\/ul><h2>About the Presenters<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-8315ec3 authorSection elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"8315ec3\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-d76f197\" data-id=\"d76f197\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-872dc9a elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"872dc9a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/vanessa-kelly-labor-employment-attorney-member-clark-hill-plc.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-18084\" alt=\"Headshot of Vanessa Kelly\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/vanessa-kelly-labor-employment-attorney-member-clark-hill-plc.jpg 600w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/vanessa-kelly-labor-employment-attorney-member-clark-hill-plc-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/vanessa-kelly-labor-employment-attorney-member-clark-hill-plc-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-66 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-d089d10\" data-id=\"d089d10\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5e3ea61 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5e3ea61\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Vanessa Kelly, PLC<\/h3><p><span style=\"color: #333333;\">Labor &amp; Employment Attorney, Member with Clark Hill, PLC,<\/span><\/p><p>Vanessa Kelly is a Labor &amp; Employment Attorney and a Member with <a href=\"https:\/\/www.clarkhill.com\/about\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Clark Hill, PLC<\/a>, a full-service, global law firm. Vanessa\u2019s clients seek her experienced, confident counsel in addressing their employee management needs. She provides legal services including risk assessment and risk avoidance in employee terminations, accommodating disabilities, addressing workplace misconduct, protecting key personnel and proprietary information, performing reductions in force, and implementation of workplace policies designed to avoid disputes and comply with state and federal law, to name a few.<\/p><p>Vanessa also defends employers before federal and state courts and civil rights agencies. Vanessa earned her J.D. at George Washington University Law School, and is licensed in both NJ and NY.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-197b3a2 authorSection elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"197b3a2\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-a9e249c\" data-id=\"a9e249c\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f70c8c8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"f70c8c8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/melinda-lapan-vice-president-hr-advantage-advisory.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-18085\" alt=\"Headshot of Melinda Lapan\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/melinda-lapan-vice-president-hr-advantage-advisory.jpg 600w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/melinda-lapan-vice-president-hr-advantage-advisory-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/melinda-lapan-vice-president-hr-advantage-advisory-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-66 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-f60fc55\" data-id=\"f60fc55\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-91cd212 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"91cd212\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Melinda Lapan, PLC<\/h3><p><span style=\"color: #333333;\">Vice President of HR Advantage Advisory<\/span><\/p><p>Melinda Lapan is Vice President of <a href=\"https:\/\/hr-aa.com\/about-us\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">HR Advantage Advisory<\/a>, a subsidiary of Clark Hill. HR Advantage Advisory provides HR outsourcing and consulting services.<\/p><p>Melinda has over 20 years of Generalist experience in Human Resources, having worked in various HR leadership roles across multiple industries prior to joining HR-AA. She has a Master of Business Administration (MBA) degree, she holds two HR certifications and is a <a href=\"https:\/\/www.asq.org\/cert\/six-sigma-green-belt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Six Sigma Green Belt<\/a>.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"author":19,"featured_media":15026,"template":"","meta":{"_seopress_robots_primary_cat":"","_seopress_titles_title":"Webinar: Employment Issues Every ABA Provider Should Know","_seopress_titles_desc":"Common employment issues faced by businesses and entrepreneurs.